# ZAS³ asset credits
#
# Every file under a project's src/<set>/resources/assets/ directory has one
# entry here (NFR-045). All assets are licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 International;
# see LICENSE-ASSETS. scripts/check_credits.py checks this file in CI.
#
# Format
#
# An entry is a block of "key: value" lines. Blank lines separate entries.
# Lines starting with "#" are comments. Each entry starts with "path", the
# file's path from the repository root, with forward slashes.
#
# An asset derived from a vgstation13 sprite records where it came from:
#
#   path: zas-atmos/src/main/resources/assets/zas_atmos/textures/block/canister.png
#   source: icons/obj/atmos.dmi
#   state: yellow
#   commit: 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567
#   attribution: vgstation13 contributors, CC BY-SA 3.0 US
#
#   source       the .dmi file, as a path in the vgstation13 repository.
#                Never a file under goon/ (CC BY-NC-SA, NFR-041).
#   state        the icon state used. List several separated by ", ".
#   commit       the full 40-character vgstation13 commit hash.
#   attribution  must name the vgstation13 contributors.
#
# An asset drawn from scratch says so:
#
#   path: zas/src/main/resources/assets/zas/textures/item/gauge.png
#   source: original
#
# Either kind may add "author: <name>" and "notes: <text>".
#
# Run the check locally with: python scripts/check_credits.py

